  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given a circle passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, so its equation will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On putting the given values we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now dividing both side by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now differentiating with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
